18$ and $11$ is prime" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401615 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401615 1084 #uuid "95645e07-ad94-5f53-94f7-cca49c5ad899" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401616 1081 "$3\\,|\\,18$ and $11$ is prime" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401616 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401616 1084 #uuid "d8dae576-92ac-54ed-a811-031ffd21fa2e" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401617 1081 "$3\\,|\\,18$ and $11$ is not prime" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401617 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401617 1084 #uuid "42432f20-0241-59fd-b7c8-f9f2bbb70103" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401618 1081 "$3\\,\\text{⧸}|\\,18$ or $11$ is prime" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401618 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401618 1084 #uuid "4e68f1f1-4450-5751-bd58-9f125f0beedf" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401619 1068 #edb/ref 17592186401620 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401619 1069 "q-171998" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401619 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401619 1071 "$\\,$ $∃q\\in Q,\\,3q=2.$\n\nWhich of the following expresses the statement given above?" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401619 1072 #uuid "2fa1ebd9-8d46-5a04-b414-ffbaef5b882d" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401619 1074 "The existential quantifier \"$∃$\" means \"there exists.\" So, our quantified statement reads as follows:\n\n$\\,$ **There exists** $q\\in Q$ **such that** $3q=2.$ \n\nThis can be further simplified as follows:\n\n$\\,$ There exists a rational number whose triple is $2.$\n\n**Note:** This statement is true." 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401620 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401621 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401620 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401622 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401620 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401623 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401620 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401624 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401620 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401625 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401620 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401620 1077 "selection" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401620 1079 #edb/ref 17592186401621 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401620 1080 #uuid "516df518-0f30-5fe7-9381-34b1cbb3ff17" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401621 1081 "There exists a rational number whose triple is $2.$" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401621 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401621 1084 #uuid "dfbc4514-da7a-5d32-bb0c-75cb3c1af14e" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401622 1081 "There exists no rational number whose triple is $2.$" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401622 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401622 1084 #uuid "00b16d7a-3879-5b16-a22b-05c9128f9304" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401623 1081 "There exists a rational number whose triple is a multiple of $2.$" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401623 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401623 1084 #uuid "445c2f89-43cc-540c-a4c7-441ca2f3d468" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401624 1081 "Triple every rational number is not $2.$" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401624 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401624 1084 #uuid "db52d8b1-5884-5600-886d-f29af9a8111f" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401625 1081 "Triple every rational number is $2.$" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401625 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401625 1084 #uuid "33760338-3c64-54bf-8af4-8c4133bc6f27" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401626 1068 #edb/ref 17592186401627 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401626 1069 "q-171999" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401626 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401626 1071 "$\\,$ $∀x\\in (0,1),\\,x>{x}^{2}$\n\nWhich of the following expresses the statement given above?" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401626 1072 #uuid "698421f5-96c5-5307-a8fb-d2ac4a250cc1" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401626 1074 "The universal quantifier \"$∀$\" means \"for all.\" So, our quantified statement reads as follows:\n\n$\\,$ **For all** $x\\in (0,1),\\,x>{x}^{2}.$\n\nThis can be further simplified as follows:\n\n$\\,$ Every number between $0$ and $1$ is greater than its square.\n\n**Note:** This statement is true." 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401627 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401628 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401627 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401629 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401627 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401630 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401627 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401631 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401627 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401632 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401627 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401627 1077 "selection" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401627 1079 #edb/ref 17592186401632 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401627 1080 #uuid "e4f005b5-9729-5d5f-b912-f7b0246c77fd" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401628 1081 "There exists a number between $0$ and $1$ that is greater than its square." 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401628 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401628 1084 #uuid "0fe9a0e2-c6d2-56ac-b91e-b2347fd649b4" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401629 1081 "Consider the square of every number between $0$ and $1.$" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401629 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401629 1084 #uuid "286a7a4d-b364-5fd1-bc1c-cdcc0f25f9a8" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401630 1081 "Every number is greater than its square." 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401630 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401630 1084 #uuid "676c24b5-3446-5b45-8adc-2f8128e722d4" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401631 1081 "There is a number whose square is between $0$ and $1.$" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401631 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401631 1084 #uuid "db1e01e2-6988-5261-bb19-4bde540dddf9" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401632 1081 "Every number between $0$ and $1$ is greater than its square." 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401632 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401632 1084 #uuid "9830dd3d-604d-5712-a275-601b3e2f9f76" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401633 1068 #edb/ref 17592186401634 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401633 1069 "q-17392" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401633 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401633 1071 "Given that $y=2{x}^{e}-ln⁡x$, find the instantaneous rate of change at $x=1.$" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401633 1072 #uuid "104d7814-9b21-55a2-864d-c61ec56f5c8f" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401633 1074 "To find the instantaneous rate of change at a given point, we have to find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ at that point.\n\nTaking the derivative, we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2{x}^{e}-ln⁡x) \\\\  & =2e{x}^{e-1}-\\frac{1}{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the instantaneous rate of change at $x=1$ is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=1} & ={(2e{x}^{e-1}-\\frac{1}{x})|}_{x=1} \\\\  & =2e\\cdot {1}^{e-1}-\\frac{1}{1} \\\\  & =2e-1\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401634 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401635 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401634 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401636 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401634 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401637 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401634 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401638 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401634 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401639 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401634 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401634 1077 "selection" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401634 1079 #edb/ref 17592186401636 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401634 1080 #uuid "5088efea-7f9e-57d5-8f9c-14c688a0e06b" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401635 1081 "2e" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401635 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401635 1084 #uuid "0beb1ecb-7649-51d5-8923-8085f1d146bc" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401636 1081 "2e-1" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401636 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401636 1084 #uuid "aa5ec049-b8d0-5c17-a28c-05813122674f" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401637 1081 "2" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401637 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401637 1084 #uuid "c2d87b1b-17a5-523c-a973-f5e0ad287cd3" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401638 1081 "2e+1" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401638 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401638 1084 #uuid "ea4f4094-0cfd-5ae4-8308-88f0b83b2c27" 13194139533486 17592186045585 tru