 $2.$\"\n\nFinally, we can write the sentence more concisely:\n\n\"$x$ is rational and less than $2.$\"" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401681 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401682 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401681 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401683 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401681 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401684 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401681 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401685 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401681 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401686 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401681 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401681 1077 "selection" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401681 1079 #edb/ref 17592186401686 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401681 1080 #uuid "dbf0b017-304e-58e5-9a9f-333116d74094" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401682 1081 "$x$ is rational or less than $2$" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401682 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401682 1084 #uuid "ce66c39b-76e7-547b-8560-3f8586f07d61" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401683 1081 "$x$ is neither rational nor less than $2$" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401683 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401683 1084 #uuid "15d749ae-772a-5eae-be65-5432afc6b914" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401684 1081 "$x$ is rational" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401684 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401684 1084 #uuid "4d40f6cc-c5d5-5763-a712-bf7b4204ab5d" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401685 1081 "$x$ is rational but not less than $2$" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401685 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401685 1084 #uuid "bbda7dd0-e8b9-50bc-83b4-ebc0a9a52b4e" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401686 1081 "$x