r formal English. So, the phrase effectively conveys that one of the two stated conditions will hold true." 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401729 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401730 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401729 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401731 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401729 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401732 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401729 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401733 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401729 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401734 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401729 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401729 1077 "selection" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401729 1079 #edb/ref 17592186401732 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401729 1080 #uuid "1369236f-0d85-59b3-8f09-5b7bf8330423" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401730 1081 "Don't exercise regularly, and you won't improve your health." 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401730 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401730 1084 #uuid "56a88b2d-31e2-5c81-b7af-10adf58dcfe5" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401731 1081 "Either you exercise regularly, or you'll improve your health." 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401731 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401731 1084 #uuid "eeda8eae-691d-538c-893d-edf580428ade" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401732 1081 "Either you do not exercise regularly, or you'll improve your health." 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401732 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401732 1084 #uuid "f9371ba2-5ccf-57d1-a125-df93ceb1efdb" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401733 1081 "Don't exercise regularly, or you won't improve your health." 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401733 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] 