ically equivalent to the following:\n\n$\\,$ $x\\notin N,$ or $x$ is positive." 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401756 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401757 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401756 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401758 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401756 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401759 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401756 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401760 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401756 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401761 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401756 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401756 1077 "selection" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401756 1079 #edb/ref 17592186401761 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401756 1080 #uuid "75c6802b-9187-56f8-8a12-dde53fdaa099" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401757 1081 "$x\\notin N,$ or $x$ is not positive." 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401757 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401757 1084 #uuid "6c0b4ea8-c305-52fb-b738-39b52cd65224" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401758 1081 "$x\\in N,$ and $x$ is positive." 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401758 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401758 1084 #uuid "0f89fefa-c3c4-5941-854f-f243eb5a7db4" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401759 1081 "$x\\in N,$ or $x$ is positive." 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401759 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401759 1084 #uuid "fa092300-5642-58f4-a90f-6ea2281b0263" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401760 1081 "$x\\notin N,$ and $x$ is positive." 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401760 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401760 1084 #uuid "064a345b-f5c1-5e19-82b0-253407d0787b" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401761 1081 "$x\\notin N,$ or $x$ is positive." 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401761 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401761 1084 #uuid "54036453-852b-5e55-ab90-eafbae198c5e" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401762 1068 #edb/ref 17592186401763 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401762 1069 "q-183452" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401762 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401762 1071 "Negate the following statement:\n\n$\\,$ For all $t\\in Q,$ $t<1.$" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401762 1072 #uuid "030c3e29-d504-53d7-8a01-ca59114f9c38" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401762 1074 "If we denote\n\n$$\nP(t):t<1,\n$$\n\nour statement can be written as\n\n$$\n∀t\\in Q,\\,P(t).\n$$\n\nNegating this, we obtain\n\n$$\n¬(∀t\\in Q,\\,P(t))≡∃t\\in Q,\\,¬P(t).\n$$\n\nFinally, $∃t\\in Q,\\,¬P(t)$ reads as follows:\n\n$\\,$ **There exists** $t\\in Q$ such that $t\\ge 1.$" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401763 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401764 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401763 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401765 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401763 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401766 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401763 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401767 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401763 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401768 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401763 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401763 1077 "selection" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401763 1079 #edb/ref 17592186401765 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401763 1080 #uuid "57eaefa3-f6a7-50a6-968d-23bf7fb1f0aa" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401764 1081 "There exists $t\\in Q$ such that $t<1.$" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401764 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401764 1084 #uuid "81cd1e65-4f9b-54b2-b