486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401802 1081 "For all real number $x$ there is another real number $y$ such that $x+y=0.$" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401802 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401802 1084 #uuid "24715df5-3648-57cf-a0c2-7c8757e47346" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401803 1081 "There are real numbers $x$ and $y$ such that $x+y=0.$" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401803 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401803 1084 #uuid "5e8dff61-a1b8-558a-96c5-06cbb8e259d4" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401804 1068 #edb/ref 17592186401805 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401804 1069 "q-18688" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401804 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401804 1071 "Find the solution of the following system:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}b=2a-1 \\\\ 1.5a+0.5b=2.5\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401804 1072 #uuid "8748ba37-2d9a-5451-b497-621aa22378b8" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401804 1074 "To get rid of the decimals, we multiply the second equation by $10,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}b=2a-1 &  \\\\ 1.5a+0.5b=2.5 & |\\,\\times 10\\end{aligned}\\,⟹\\,{\\begin{aligned}b=2a-1 \\\\ 15a+5b=25\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that the first equation is already solved for $b:$\n\n$$\nb=2a-1\n$$\n\nNow, to find the value of $a,$ we can substitute $b=2a-1$ into the second equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}15a+5(2a-1) & =25 \\\\ 15a+10a-5 & =25 \\\\ 25a & =30 \\\\ a & =\\frac{30}{25} \\\\ a & =1.2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute $a=1.2$ into the  first equation to get:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}b & =2(1.2)-1 \\\\  & =2.4-1 \\\\  & =1.4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, the solution to the system of equations is $a=1.2$ and $b=1.4.$" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401805 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401806 13194