1084 #uuid "63214331-a811-5bf2-8cb7-4da5c8c1d678" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401815 1081 "2{x}^{4}{csc}^{2}⁡x-8{x}^{3}cot⁡x" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401815 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401815 1084 #uuid "2285f6af-f131-5a62-954e-164127014717" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401816 1081 "2{x}^{2}csc⁡x-8{x}^{3}cot⁡x" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401816 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401816 1084 #uuid "5a35c415-50b4-5005-8173-6121abbd643e" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401817 1081 "2{x}^{4}{csc}^{2}⁡x+8{x}^{3}tan⁡x" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401817 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401817 1084 #uuid "cb8e226f-a28c-5b1a-b7df-6f312bfd06a3" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401818 1068 #edb/ref 17592186401819 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401818 1069 "q-19299" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401818 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401818 1071 "The position $s(t)$ of a particle at time $t$ is given by \n\n$$\ns(t)=4{e}^{-t}+3{t}^{2}-2t+1,\\,t\\ge 0.\n$$\n\nCalculate the velocity at time $t=2.$ Round your answer to $2$ decimal places." 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401818 1072 #uuid "59ea1544-758d-5928-bf3f-4995dd8b61f1" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401818 1074 "First, we calculate the velocity function by differentiating the position function:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}s}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(4{e}^{-t}+3{t}^{2}-2t+1) \\\\  & =-4{e}^{-t}+6t-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo calculate the velocity at $t=2,$ we substitute $t=2$ into the velocity function above:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(2) & =-4{e}^{-2}+6\\cdot 2-2 \\\\  & =-4{e}^{-2}+10 \\\\  & =9.458\\,658… \\\\  & ≈9.46\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401819 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401820 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401819 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401821 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401819 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401822 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401819 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401823 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401819 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401824 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401819 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401819 1077 "selection" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401819 1079 #edb/ref 17592186401820 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401819 1080 #uuid "ab640647-5232-553a-be5a-08e8539221b0" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401820 1081 "v=9.46" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401820 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401820 1084 #uuid "e41ae0ea-e83b-581f-a124-c29c127545ab" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401821 1081 "v=4.94" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401821 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401821 1084 #uuid "2ddc81bc-6b74-5b86-9aa6-68b7985e21ee" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401822 1081 "v=10.03" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401822 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401822 1084 #uuid "4c2d52e0-5f90-57ca-a8a9-c0f4aaadbdfb" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401823 1081 "v=9.24" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401823 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401823 1084 #uuid "e34561e5-c74f-5726-99b2-cd744a8924ae" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401824 1081 "v=8.36" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401824 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401824 1084 #uuid "eea394a2-6e5a-5394-a910-d19a50a2530e" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401825 1068 #edb/ref 17592186401826 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401825 1069 "q-19302" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401825 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401825 1071 "The position $s(t)$ of a particle at time $t$ is given by \n\n$$\ns(t)={t}^{2}-2t+\\operatorname{ln}⁡t,\\,t>0.\n$$\n\nCalculate the velocity at time $t=3.$ Round your answer to $2$ decimal places." 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401825 1072 #uuid "3df15b1d-5c6a-5a31-88c3-94f27234c33f" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401825 1074 "First, we calculate the velocity function by differentiating the position function:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}s}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({t}^{2}-2t+\\operatorname{ln}⁡t) \\\\  & =2t-2+\\frac{1}{t}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo calculate the velocity at $t=3,$ we substitute $t=3$ into the velocity function above:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(3) & =2(3)-2+\\frac{1}{3} \\\\  & =6-2+\\frac{1}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{13}{3} \\\\  & =4.333\\,333… \\\\  & ≈4.33\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401826 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401827 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401826 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401828 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401826 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401829 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401826 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401830 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401826 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401831 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401826 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401826 1077 "selection" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401826 1079 #edb/ref 17592186401829 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401826 1080 #uuid "2dc005a4-0a0a-5369-9aa9-e0229fc91626" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401827 1081 "v=6.67" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401827 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401827 1084 #uuid "9733cf69-5d70-514e-a80d-eadad1d41489" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401828 1081 "v=8.05" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401828 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401828 1084 #uuid "85286b89-c2a3-56c9-a420-e9d18189a069" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401829 1081 "v=4.33" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401829 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401829 1084 #uuid "259c571e-8927-56b2-95c0-5bb1688deec4" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401830 1081 "v=3.75" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401830 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401830 1084 #uuid "1ebd6114-b8d6-5140-a703-c4dd01c13274" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401831 1081 "v=0.22" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401831 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401831 1084 #uuid "5f2eab8c-d466-5781-91a5-1f6a93c6b3d4" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401832 1068 #edb/ref 17592186401833 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401832 1069 "q-19493" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401832 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401832 1071 "Use the first two non-zero terms of the Taylor expansion of ${x}^{1/3}$ about $x=8$ to approximate the value of ${7}^{1/3}.$" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401832 1072 #uuid "c2001916-7ed2-504f-9a8e-d02fda09253a" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401832 1074 "We use Taylor's formula in the form\n\n$$\nf(x)=f(a)+{f}^{′}(a)(x-a)+\\frac{{f}^{″}(a)}{2!}(x-a)^{2}+⋯,\n$$\n\nwith $a=8.$ \n\nCalculating the necessary derivatives, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & ={x}^{1/3} \\\\ f(8) & ={8}^{1/3}=2 \\\\ {f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{1}{3}{x}^{-2/3} \\\\ {f}^{′}(8) & =\\frac{1}{3}(8)^{-2/3}=\\frac{1}{3\\cdot 4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the Taylor series is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{1/3} & =2+\\frac{1}{3\\cdot 4}(x-8)+⋯ \\\\  & =2+\\frac{x-8}{12}+⋯.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe substitute $x=7$ into the above to approximate ${7}^{1/3}.$ We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{7}^{1/3} & ≈2+\\frac{7-8}{12} \\\\  & =2-\\frac{1}{12} \\\\  & =\\frac{23}{12}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401833 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401834 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401833 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401835 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401833 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401836 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401833 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401837 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401833 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401838 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401833 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401833 1077 "selection" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401833 1079 #edb/ref 17592186401838 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401833 1080 #uuid "6c042d42-f6d6-52fa-992c-350b4e969301" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401834 1081 "{7}^{1/3}≈\\frac{2}{3}" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401834 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401834 1084 #uuid "d1d3691b-a1a5-5e81-bfe2-760939975d1d" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401835 1081 "{7}^{1/3}≈\\frac{25}{12}" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401835 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401835 1084 #uuid "7ebae067-1d98-5398-842f-52e5beff87e6" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401836 1081 "{7}^{1/3}≈\\frac{4}{3}" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401836 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401836 1084 #uuid "1270a921-f7ad-5051-be4e-3a8d359de937" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401837 1081 "{7}^{1/3}≈\\frac{3}{4}" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401837 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401837 1084 #uuid "83d51c96-b38e-5a00-a86c-b8ab59d290d0" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401838 1081 "{7}^{1/3}≈\\frac{23}{12}" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401838 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401838 1084 #uuid "dcada4a4-8b8c-5274-9b06-9d7f2171686e" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401839 1068 #edb/ref 17592186401840 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401839 1069 "q-20362" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401839 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401839 1071 "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 2 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 4 & 3 & 4 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401839 1072 #uuid "b5cb76d6-8596-56c0-bf91-5764390c6dbb" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401839 1074 "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$, $y$, and $z,$ then, the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}2x+y+2z=1 \\\\ 3x+2y+3z=2 \\\\ 4x+3y+4z=3.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401840 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401841 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401840 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401842 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401840 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401843 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401840 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401844 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401840 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401845 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401840 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401840 1077 "selection" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401840 1079 #edb/ref 17592186401843 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401840 1080 #uuid "a8af118b-89c1-56df-aee8-e8ea929b9eb7" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401841 1081 "{\\begin{aligned}2x+y-2z=1 \\\\ 3x+2y+3z=2 \\\\ 4x+3y+4z=3\\end{aligned}" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401841 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401841 1084 #uuid "7ddbc91f-a2bc-5c20-979a-ce7e906dc06d" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401842 1081 "{\\begin{aligned}2x+y+2z=1 \\\\ 3x-2y+3z=2 \\\\ 4x+3y+4z=3\\end{aligned}" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401842 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401842 1084 #uuid "ca1394d8-a03f-5e29-aaba-bb0176d8f59b" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401843 1081 "{\\begin{aligned}2x+y+2z=1 \\\\ 3x+2y+3z=2 \\\\ 4x+3y+4z=3\\end{aligned}" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401843 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401843 1084 #uuid "9761f4c8-5981-5fd5-88ce-d6d56601691c" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401844 1081 "{\\begin{aligned}2x+y+2z=1 \\\\ x+2y+3z=2 \\\\ 4x+3y+z=3\\end{aligned}" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401844 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401844 1084 #uuid "13919b67-24a3-5f25-90aa-a16013b5b7e6" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401845 1081 "{\\begin{aligned}2x+y+2z=1 \\\\ 3x+y+3z=-2 \\\\ x+3y+4z=3\\end{aligned}" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401845 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401845 1084 #uuid "2f7be1b8-6206-50f4-9b88-856c8d8e718a" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401846 1068 #edb/ref 17592186401847 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401846 1069 "q-20851" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401846 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401846 1071 "For the parametric curve \n\n$$\nx=2\\sqrt{t},\\,y=12t+1,\\,0\\le t<\\infty ,\n$$\n\n find the derivative $\\frac{dy}{dx}$ at the point $P$ on the curve where $t=1.$" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401846 1072 #uuid "a11f695c-004e-57f4-b1f5-cd09434f69e2" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401846 1074 "We will use the formula\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{{y}^{′}(t)}{{x}^{′}(t)}.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating $x$ and $y,$ we get\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{t}},\\,{y}^{′}(t)=12.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{12}{\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{t}}}=12\\sqrt{t}.\n$$\n\nAt the point where $t=1$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx} & =12\\sqrt{1} \\\\  & =12\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401847 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401848 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401847 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401849 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401847 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401850 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401847 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401851 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401847 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401852 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401847 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401847 1077 "selection" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401847 1079 #edb/ref 17592186401848 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401847 1080 #uuid "0ec6f4c2-cef2-5136-bda0-046075ea56a5" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401848 1081 "12" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401848 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401848 1084 #uuid "1e5ec4eb-fb50-5d50-87c7-e15a073c23f5" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401849 1081 "10" 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [17592186401849 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533486 17592186045585 true] [